(7483129, 1190168, 54446, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouetted person on the silhouetted rock.  With all due respect, this is the opposite of Low Contrast.  Furthermore, again with all due respect, you really need to clean your sensor of dust spots.  Suggest Pec pads, Eclipse fluid and the right sized sensor cleaning swiper.</td>', 'I like the silhouetted person on the silhouetted rock.  With all due respect, this is the opposite of Low Contrast.  Furthermore, again with all due respect, you really need to clean your sensor of dust spots.  Suggest Pec pads, Eclipse fluid and the right sized sensor cleaning swiper.', '2016-11-18 08:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
